      <activity id="022d6b08-6132-5255-81c8-d1b7321ed08d" activityNameId="2ff220ea-3afa-5064-a852-b34292d39d5c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 3.4MW, onshore, moving parts</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 3.4MW, onshore, moving parts
UUID=222d5085-a9c1-3f7f-a90d-dddc79549fd3
Wind turbine moving parts (without tower and substructure), at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the IEA reference 3.4MW onshore wind turbine (Bortolotti et al., 2019; Cooperman et al., 2023).
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_222d5085-a9c1-3f7f-a90d-dddc79549fd3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
